      "alt": "Table Mountain and Lion's Head rise behind the city, with Green Point and the stadium on the Atlantic shore.",
      "name": "",
      "focus": "",
      "title": "",
      "source": "",
      "filename": "https://a.storyblok.com/f/295888311565739/468fb0f322/cape-town-aerial.jpg",
